1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:09,801
This video shows a friendly page for a missing link, with a boat on a moving sea. It is two animations, layered with a few lines of styles.

2
00:00:10,333 --> 00:00:15,871
Our page already says what happened, and offers a way back. Let's add the sea at the bottom.

3
00:00:25,167 --> 00:00:29,764
The sea file repeats forever. The style pins it to the bottom of the scene.

4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,299
Now the boat, on top of the sea.

5
00:00:43,633 --> 00:00:51,966
The boat is a second file, drawn over the sea. Each one plays on its own, and together they read as one picture.

6
00:00:53,200 --> 00:01:00,697
So, two small files and a few lines of styles. Layers let each part move in its own way.
